# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Large training data - not in git. See DATA.md for provenance and
#  how to obtain or regenerate each file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
datasets/*.csv
datasets/px4_raw/*.ulg

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  RandomForest checkpoints - ~980 MB each, 5.9 GB total, regenerable
#  in minutes via ablation_matrix.py. Every other checkpoint (.pth,
#  gbt_*.pkl, scalers, PPO .zip) IS tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ai_backend/models/rf_*.pkl

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Generated documents - the analysis lives in the .md files and in the
#  thesis PDF; the Word/HTML/PowerPoint renders are build artifacts.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.docx
*.pptx
~$*
runs/analysis_report.docx
runs/analysis_report.html

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
